---

<!-- <BaseLayout title="Get Involved - BluePrintNZ"> -->
  <div class="container mx-auto px-4 py-8">
    <!-- <Breadcrumbs items={breadcrumbItems} /> -->
    
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-6 text-secondary">Get Involved</h1>
      
      <div class="bg-primary/10 p-6 rounded-lg mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3 text-secondary">Make a Difference</h2>
        <p class="mb-4">
          There are many ways you can get involved with BluePrintNZ and help make a difference in the lives of those affected.
          Whether you have a little time or a lot, there's a way for you to contribute.
        </p>
        <p>
          Your involvement helps us raise awareness, fund research, and provide support to those who need it most.
        </p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-10">
        <div class="border border-neutral-300 rounded-lg p-6">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-3 text-secondary">Volunteer Opportunities</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2 list-disc pl-5">
            <li>Community outreach programs</li>
            <li>Event organization and support</li>
            <li>Administrative assistance</li>
            <li>Peer support networks</li>
            <li>Public speaking and advocacy</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="mt-4">
            <a href="#" class="text-accent hover:underline font-medium">Learn more about volunteering →</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="border border-neutral-300 rounded-lg p-6">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-3 text-secondary">Fundraising</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2 list-disc pl-5">
            <li>Organize a fundraising event</li>
            <li>Participate in sponsored challenges</li>
            <li>Corporate partnerships</li>
            <li>Community fundraising</li>
            <li>Legacy giving</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="mt-4">
            <a href="#" class="text-accent hover:underline font-medium">Start fundraising today →</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 text-secondary">Upcoming Events</h2>
      <p class="mb-6">
        Join us at one of our upcoming events to connect with others, learn more about our work,
        and find ways to get involved.
      </p>
      
      <div class="space-y-4 mb-8">
        <div class="border border-neutral-300 rounded-lg p-4">
          <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center justify-between">
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-semibold text-secondary">Annual Awareness Walk</h3>
              <p class="text-sm">September 15, 2025 • Auckland Domain</p>
            </div>
            <a href="#" class="mt-2 md:mt-0 bg-accent text-neutral py-1 px-4 rounded-lg text-center hover:bg-accent/80 transition-colors text-sm">
              Register
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="border border-neutral-300 rounded-lg p-4">
          <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center justify-between">
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-semibold text-secondary">Community Support Workshop</h3>
              <p class="text-sm">October 5, 2025 • Wellington Community Center</p>
            </div>
            <a href="#" class="mt-2 md:mt-0 bg-accent text-neutral py-1 px-4 rounded-lg text-center hover:bg-accent/80 transition-colors text-sm">
              Register
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="border border-neutral-300 rounded-lg p-4">
          <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center justify-between">
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-semibold text-secondary">Charity Gala Dinner</h3>
              <p class="text-sm">November 12, 2025 • Christchurch Convention Centre</p>
            </div>
            <a href="#" class="mt-2 md:mt-0 bg-accent text-neutral py-1 px-4 rounded-lg text-center hover:bg-accent/80 transition-colors text-sm">
              Buy Tickets
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="bg-semantic/10 p-6 rounded-lg">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3 text-secondary">Contact Our Volunteer Coordinator</h3>
        <p class="mb-4">
          Ready to get involved? Our volunteer coordinator is here to help you find the perfect opportunity.
        </p>
        <a href="#" class="bg-semantic text-neutral py-2 px-4 rounded-lg inline-block hover:bg-semantic/80 transition-colors">
          Get in Touch
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
<!-- </BaseLayout> -->
